  message: "A live instance from WI-rabum-zatur-rufav-busol-lurop-gisur-zojif-gidun: with a project `object out { def println(x: String): Unit = {} }`, `out.println(k)` emits scala:external:0-0:println:unresolved (no hint), so a never-logs-a-secret claim reads confirmed_with_caveats (untyped_receiver at that println) before and after WI-rabum. Pinned as a control (verdict in confirmed / confirmed_with_caveats) in packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/tests/test_jvm_stdio_writes.py::test_a_secret_handed_to_a_user_out_is_not_logged[scala]; if this item lands and the call resolves, that control should tighten to confirmed."  # 4171
